{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++ code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++ code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\nusing ll = long long;\nconst ll MOD = 1000000007LL;\n\ninline ll modmul(ll a, ll b, ll m) {\n    return (a % m) * (b % m) % m;\n}\n\nll modPow(ll base, ll exp, ll mod) {\n    ll res = 1;\n    for (ll i = 0; i < exp; ++i) {\n        res = modmul(res, base, mod);\n    }\n    return res;\n}\n\nll modPowBase(ll base, ll exp) {\n    return modPow(base, exp, MOD);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ll p, k;\n    cin >> p >> k;\n    \n    ll rem = k % p;\n    if (rem == 1) {\n        cout << modPowBase(p, p);\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    if (rem == 0) {\n        cout << modPowBase(p, p - 1);\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    ll ord = 1;\n    for (; ord <= p - 1; ++ord) {\n        if ((p - 1) % ord != 0) continue;\n        if (modPow(k, ord, p) == 1) break;\n    }\n    \n    cout << modPowBase(p, (p - 1) / ord);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final long MOD = 1000000007L;\n\n    static long modmul(long a, long b, long m) {\n        a %= m;\n        b %= m;\n        return (a * b) % m;\n    }\n\n    static long modPow(long base, long exp, long mod) {\n        long res = 1;\n        for (long i = 0; i < exp; ++i) {\n            res = modmul(res, base, mod);\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    static long modPowBase(long base, long exp) {\n        return modPow(base, exp, MOD);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long p = scanner.nextLong();\n        long k = scanner.nextLong();\n        \n        long rem = k % p;\n        if (rem == 1) {\n            System.out.println(modPowBase(p, p));\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        if (rem == 0) {\n            System.out.println(modPowBase(p, p - 1));\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        long ord = 1;\n        for (; ord <= p - 1; ++ord) {\n            if ((p - 1) % ord != 0) continue;\n            if (modPow(k, ord, p) == 1) break;\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(modPowBase(p, (p - 1) / ord));\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0001456631434848532, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00019012074335478246, -3.2543604902457446e-05, -0.0005270045949146152, -0.024069832637906075, -8.702239938429557e-06, -3.0636318115284666e-05, -2.50339189733495e-06, -3.349725011503324e-05, -0.0017027654685080051, -1.5258672647178173e-05, -0.41641417145729065, -7.033323527139146e-06, -1.811964830267243e-05, -2.622600959512056e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -3.540453326422721e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -3.790783375734463e-05, -0.0008045773720368743, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -0.0013404440833255649, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0007427555974572897, -4.5298504119273275e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -2.6226